  {
    "id": "radius_acct_1813",
    "proto": "radius",
    "summary": "T-RADIUS-4 Accounting-Request→1813（translate 顺序修正：dst 缺席依 code==4?1813:1812 覆盖 :770 预写；code4→auto resp 5 Accounting-Response；参考 start-stop.pcap）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "radius": {
            "src_port": 12345,
            "code": 4,
            "attributes": [
              {
                "type": 40,
                "format": "uint32",
                "value": "1"
              },
              {
                "type": 4,
                "format": "ipv4",
                "value": "10.0.0.1"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 2,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "udp.dstport",
          "value": "1813"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "radius.code",
          "value": "4"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "radius.avp.type",
          "value": "40,4"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "radius.code",
          "value": "5"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "radius.rsp",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "radius.reqframe",
          "value": "1"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "RFC 2866 §3：Accounting-Request(4)→Accounting-Response(5)，IANA 1813",
        ":770 预写拿不到 spec.Radius 恒 1812——translate 自补覆盖（D-RADIUS-1 核心）",
        "40=Acct-Status-Type(Start=1)、4=NAS-IP-Address",
        "tshark 同包多 AVP 字段逗号拼接（P5 校准）"
      ]
    }
  },
